        <Paragraph>
            Use <Code>NavigationAllowed</Code> to check the current step before moving forward. In this example, enter a valid email address to continue. You can go back at any time without losing your entry.
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>
            The <Code>Validation</Code> component checks the email and shows a message beside the field. Moving forward calls <Code>Validations.ValidateAll()</Code>, whether you use Next or select a later step.
        </Paragraph>
