<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Lazy Load">
        <Code>StepsRenderMode.LazyLoad</Code> creates each step's content on its first visit and keeps it afterward.
        Enter values below and switch steps to see how the inputs retain their state.
