<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Lazy Reload">
        <Code>StepsRenderMode.LazyReload</Code> renders only the selected step's content and recreates it on each visit.
        These inputs keep their values locally, so switching steps clears them. Bind values to parent state when they need to persist.
